  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EXTENTION OF WATER RESOURCE AND TRANSMISSION FACILITIES OF THE CITY OF ALEPPO.THE PROJECT CONSISTS OF THE FOLLOWING: _ AN AQUEDUCT ABOUT 75 KM. LONG TO DELIVER 220,000 M3/D. PUMPING STATION AT LAKE ASSAD TO PRODUCE 220,000 M3/D. EXTENTIONS TO TREATMENT FACILITIES AT THE EXISTING STATIONS TO PRODUCE AN ADDITIONAL 110,000 M3/D WITH PROVISION FOR INCREASE TO 220,000 M3/D SUBSEQUENT STAGE.</narrative>
  </description>
